5. [`STUDENT-SLIDESHOW-FORGE.mdc`](./STUDENT-SLIDESHOW-FORGE.mdc) spine respected (≤ 6 Masterclass ideas + mandatory Lab/Workshop frame slides).  
6. Official contract: guía JSON — **150 h** presencial; contact-forgeable **80 h**; evaluation **60/40**.  
