## 3. Slideshow (mandatory)

Every lesson includes a Reveal deck per [`STUDENT-SLIDESHOW-FORGE.mdc`](./STUDENT-SLIDESHOW-FORGE.mdc):

- ≤ 6 Masterclass ideas from enrichment `MAIN-IDEAS.yml`
- Required **`unit_cover`** first (title / stake), then **`analysis_opener`** (geometrical) and optional analysis model (Profield)
- Lesson Markdown **must** contain Analysis method prose (language / medium / support; session-3 defence cadence) — not only a link to the deck
- Required **`lab_opener`** (geometrical) before portfolio-bound exercises
- Required **`workshop_opener`** + **`outro`** (geometrical)
- Masterclass / Lab images from Profield public-safe assets; Koch triangle only as diagram fallback (never Sierpinski; never Resource UUID in captions)
- Student voice: clear enough for a late-secondary / first-year reader; optional brief page-verified `quote` on idea slides

Map B1 → Masterclass · B2/Lab exercises → portfolio · B3/Workshop → next deliverable (D1–D3).

## 4. Waves (suggested)

